{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:20.84] When life gets overwhelming, I just go ghost\n[00:23.22] They say my life deserve a camera, I'm a GoPro\n[00:25.98] I grew up west of Indiana, where it's cold, cold\n[00:28.54] Yeah, babe, it's too cold\n[00:29.86] Jumpin' like Jordan, but my money tall as Kukoč\n[00:32.34] Need a house by the lake, just so I could buy a new boat\n[00:35.38] Nigga, this that wave, I'ma surf, we don't do boats\n[00:38.00] I'm still in the Yacht Club, bro in the Glock Club\n[00:40.74] Shots hit your spine, realigning your chakras (Realigning your chakras)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:43.32] Let's take it back to basics (Yeah)\n[00:45.56] 5-gram 'Wood, roll it up, face it (Yeah)\n[00:47.80] I'm too damn good, legend in the makin'\n[00:50.38] I be sack chasin'\n[00:51.34] Drug wastin', wasted on a daily basis\n[00:54.12] Bitch, 999, the whole world, we takin'\n[00:56.80] Shoutout to that boy, Kid LAROI, killer in the makin'\n[01:00.48] From Germany to Illinois, noise, we be makin'\n[01:02.32] Young niggas run it, got the old niggas hatin'\n[01:05.34] Picked the fruits of my labor, old niggas pickin' raisins\n[01:08.04] I'll get back to them later, I'm busy achieving greatness\n[01:10.72] Bro just bought him a laser for Glizzy, his aim amazin'\n[01:13.48] Hope you don't get in the way, we get busy, leave you on the pavement\n[01:16.14] Kill a nigga then get over it (Ayy)\n[01:17.62] Hang a nigga like a ornament (Ayy)\n[01:19.24] My mind's full of torment (Ayy)\n[01:20.38] Demons laying dormant (Ayy)\n[01:21.40] I want peace from all things\n[Chorus]\n[01:26.94] When life gets overwhelming, I just go ghost\n[01:28.70] They say my life deserve a camera, I'm a GoPro\n[01:31.44] I grew up west of Indiana, where it's cold, cold\n[01:34.02] Yeah, babe, it's too cold\n[01:35.32] Jumpin' like Jordan, but my money tall as Kukoč\n[01:37.88] Need a house by the lake, just so I could buy a new boat\n[01:40.82] Nigga, this that wave, I'ma surf, we don't do boats\n[01:43.36] I'm still in the Yacht Club, bro in the Glock Club\n[01:46.20] Shots hit your spine, realigning your chakras\n[Verse 2]\n[01:49.18] Drugs all the time, got me spinnin', helicopter\n[01:51.66] Pain in my mind and my heart, need a doctor\n[01:54.40] Said it all the time, from the start, shit get harder\n[01:57.14] Gotta push through, and we going farther and farther\n[01:59.04] Yeah, substance abuse is for the brokenhearted\n[02:02.38] Poppin' out with my tool, I'ma protect myself regardless\n[02:05.06] I've been played as a fool, but then I got smarter\n[02:08.02] Finally met my boo, she stitched my heart up\n[02:10.74] We've been in a groove, we so high, we on the moon\n[02:13.24] Ever fuck on the moon? Yeah, between me and you\n[02:15.98] You ignite my light, set off my fuse\n[02:18.64] Got a fight with the Devil, you won't let me lose (You won't let me lose)\n[Chorus]\n[02:31.76] When life gets overwhelming, I just go ghost\n[02:34.14] They say my life deserve a camera, I'm a GoPro\n[02:36.90] I grew up west of Indiana, where it's cold, cold\n[02:39.44] Yeah, babe, it's too cold\n[02:40.78] Jumpin' like Jordan, but my money tall as Kukoč\n[02:43.24] Need a house by the lake, just so I could buy a new boat\n[02:46.28] Nigga, this that wave, I'ma surf, we don't do boats\n[02:48.80] I'm still in the Yacht Club, bro in the Glock Club\n[02:51.66] Shots hit your spine, realigning your chakras (Realigning your chakras)","words":[[10.22,20.8,"[Chorus]"],[20.84,20.96,"When"],[21.02,21.18,"life"],[21.22,21.36,"gets"],[21.46,22.06,"overwhelming,"],[22.1,22.1,"I"],[22.2,22.34,"just"],[22.4,22.48,"go"],[22.72,23.12,"ghost"],[23.22,23.3,"They"],[23.38,23.52,"say"],[23.58,23.64,"my"],[23.72,23.9,"life"],[23.94,24.32,"deserve"],[24.38,24.38,"a"],[24.42,24.76,"camera,"],[24.84,24.94,"I'm"],[25.0,25.0,"a"],[25.12,25.54,"GoPro"],[25.98,25.98,"I"],[26.14,26.3,"grew"],[26.36,26.4,"up"],[26.48,26.68,"west"],[26.74,26.76,"of"],[26.84,27.4,"Indiana,"],[27.5,27.6